    {
        "text": "...Allerdale, it's no good habit to eavesdrop. Listen to your father, now."
    },
    {
        "text": "Only lowly scoundrels would hide away in the dark to plot the demise of another."
    },
    {
        "text": "Maybe they do it for their own benefit, but such stolen victories never last for long."
    },
