    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Allerdale",
        "text": "Phew..."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "She carefully, gingerly cowers inside the shadow. Her most loyal ally\u2014the tremendous suit of steam armor\u2014becomes her shield."
    },
    {
        "text": "Her fingers feel to the edge of the window, and if she can just climb over and out, she can avoid this duo's line of sight, and climb down the gutter pipe."
    },
    {
        "text": "Her skirt's filthy by now. Ailshie won't be happy about this."
    },
    {
        "text": "But as long as she's not caught..."
    },
