    {
        "text": "The sky and ground seem to spin before her eyes, the inside of Allerdale's head whirling with. Her hands and legs lose all purchase, her grasp and footing touch nothing but thin air. She plummets straight from the second story."
    },
    {
        "text": "The garden scenery screams like mad towards her head, but before she hits the stiff soil, a soft yet ample cushion catches her."
    },
    {
        "command": "playsound",
        "params": {
