        "command": "imagerotate"
    },
    {
        "text": "A cushion from where?"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, it's not even a cushion."
    },
    {
        "text": "Allerdale feels herself gently placed upon the ground."
    },
    {
        "text": "She turns to looks behind\u2014"
