    {
        "text": "Yet a Cumberland does not bow so lightly. Allerdale makes a conscious effort to keep her head held high, as high as it can go, and only then does she notice that the one in the center carries a human astride him."
    },
    {
        "text": "A girl who must be even younger than her, dressed in sumptuous ceremony, languidly sat atop his back akin to plated gold."
    },
    {
        "text": "In his mouth is held a sword... a sword that outsizes the girl by far."
    },
    {
        "text": "A deep, resonant voice arises in Allerdale's head."
    },
