        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_663_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_655_1#5$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Maid Ailshie",
        "text": "Them? Who do you mean? Her Highness Alexandrina?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_663_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_655_1#5$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Maid Ailshie",
        "text": "She's the only one there, you know."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_663_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_655_1#1$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Allerdale",
        "text": "No, them, they're golden..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_663_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_655_1#1$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Allerdale",
        "text": "He just said something to me too."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_663_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_655_1#1$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Maid Ailshie",
        "text": "Did something happen to you? Your skirt's dirty to high heaven... are you alright?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_663_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_655_1#6$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Allerdale",
        "text": "I... I'm not sure."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_663_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_655_1#6$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Allerdale",
        "text": "Stars... stars fell into the room upstairs."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_663_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_655_1#6$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Allerdale",
        "text": "The steam knight... armor... it gave those scoundrels a beating!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_663_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_655_1#6$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Maid Ailshie",
        "text": "I don't understand what you're telling me."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_663_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_655_1#10$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Allerdale",
        "text": "Ailshie, I feel really dizzy."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_663_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_655_1#10$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Maid Ailshie",
        "text": "You need some proper rest. Who hasn't lost their head, seeing all of this? Far too much has happened today."
    },
    {
        "command": "musicvolume",
        "params": {
            "volume": 0.2,
            "fadetime": 1
        }
    },
    {
