    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_176",
            "name2": "avg_npc_175",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Noble Lady",
        "text": "Did you see? Her Royal Highness Alexandrina came back with the missing Sighs of Kings!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_176",
            "name2": "avg_npc_175",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Noble Gentleman",
        "text": "The cheers from the gardens were practically shaking all the windows and walls. Hardly anyone believed their own eyes. Her Highness Alexandrina in the flesh\u2014and her age, how young is she still?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_176",
            "name2": "avg_npc_175",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Noble Lady",
        "text": "'A miracle,' everyone's calling it."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_176",
            "name2": "avg_npc_175",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Noble Gentleman",
        "text": "Yes, a miracle, of course it is."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_176",
            "name2": "avg_npc_175",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Noble Gentleman",
        "text": "The greatest difference between miracles and coincidence is that miracles never descend for no reason in the time and place they do."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_176",
            "name2": "avg_npc_175",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Noble Gentleman",
        "text": "It'll be His Majesty's birthday soon... How could I not consider this magical affair a splendid portent of things to come?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_176",
            "name2": "avg_npc_175",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Noble Lady",
        "text": "Do give that a rest. They put on this whole auteur-styled drama for the merriment of anyone watching."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_176",
            "name2": "avg_npc_175",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Noble Lady",
        "text": "What I'm suddenly minding is the opinion some dukes have of His Majesty and our Duke of Cumberland..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_176",
            "name2": "avg_npc_175",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Noble Gentleman",
        "text": "Leave it there. All worries on the backburner, now. The dinner party's about to begin."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_176",
            "name2": "avg_npc_175",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Noble Lady",
        "text": "You're quite right. Let's enjoy everything here to the fullest\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_176",
            "name2": "avg_npc_175"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Noble Gentleman & Noble Lady",
        "text": "God save Victoria!"
    },
    {
        "command": "musicvolume",
        "params": {
            "volume": 0.2,
            "fadetime": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
