    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Impassioned Voice",
        "text": "...It seems the people's attentions are on Alexandrina's adventure."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sullen Voice",
        "text": "Your Majesty... you knew beforehand Her Highness would enter the cavern underground?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Impassioned Voice",
        "text": "It was a fine opportunity. With me out of the Palace, the diligent guards could more easily chatter, or perhaps sleep on the job, and thus let this little intruder of ours slip by."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sullen Voice",
        "text": "So you planned all this."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Impassioned Voice",
        "text": "Half was his fine improvisation. He does like a harmless little practical joke on us humans now and then."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sullen Voice",
        "text": "If he went along with this, does that imply he, too, considered this a necessary deed?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Impassioned Voice",
        "text": "...Londinium will be soon for summer. Awfully stuffy days, and torrents of rain from time to time. You're planning to send Allerdale and the wife out of the city yourself, aren't you?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sullen Voice",
        "text": "Your Majesty! My intention has always been but one, I simply..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Impassioned Voice",
        "text": "Robert, you adore your daughter, as do I."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Impassioned Voice",
        "text": "We are to wager everything for Victoria's present, but they are Victoria's future. On the off-chance we <i>do</i> fail..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sullen Voice",
        "text": "We will not, Your Majesty. I will ensure the worst case does not happen, if it takes my very life."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Impassioned Voice",
        "text": "I'm filled with great courage and confidence at our prospects. Still, it doesn't hinder me from planning just the most minute escape option for Alexandrina."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Impassioned Voice",
        "text": "She'll be ruling Victoria sooner or later. Is it so wrong to have her get to grips with this city in advance?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Impassioned Voice",
        "text": "And a similar farce still more or less served to right the balance, on this stifling-seeming afternoon."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Impassioned Voice",
        "text": "Under all this pressure, the people's spirits need a little boost. <i>That</i> is what we're met here for."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Impassioned Voice",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Impassioned Voice",
        "text": "Of course... we all have some premonition. Hence why we made these calculations, correct?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sullen Voice",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Impassioned Voice",
        "text": "Come, Robert. Once you're done with your tea, we'll be due downstairs."
    },
    {
