            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Allerdale",
        "text": "I hear music. That's the band Dad and His Majesty invited?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_663_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_655_1#1$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Maid Ailshie",
        "text": "Yes, Miss Allerdale. The dinner party's about to begin."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_663_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_655_1#1$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Allerdale",
        "text": "Everyone's so happy."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_663_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_655_1#1$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Maid Ailshie",
        "text": "Aren't you, too?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_663_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_655_1#8$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Allerdale",
        "text": "Ailshie... will the days go on like this forever?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_663_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_655_1#8$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Allerdale",
        "text": "Me and you, and Dad, and Mum... we'll always be together?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_663_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_655_1#8$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Maid Ailshie",
        "text": "I don't know, Miss Allerdale. But I believe nothing ever stays completely the same, just as the flowers in the garden."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_663_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_655_1#6$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Allerdale",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_663_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_655_1#1$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Allerdale",
        "text": "No. There are some things that will never change, Ailshie!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_663_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_655_1#1$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Allerdale",
        "text": "I'll grow up to be a Steam Knight, just like Sir Lynch! No, even greater than Sir Lynch!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_663_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_655_1#9$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Allerdale",
        "text": "I'll protect you all, and I'll drive every scoundrel away."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_663_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_655_1#9$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Allerdale",
        "text": "I'll uphold the glory of Cumberland, just like my great-great-great-great grandmother!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_663_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_655_1#1$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Allerdale",
        "text": "I promise this, Ailshie! You'll see!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_663_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_655_1#1$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Maid Ailshie",
        "text": "Miss..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_663_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_655_1#9$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Allerdale",
        "text": "...I'm not leaving Londinium. You're not allowed to leave either, Ailshie."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_663_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_655_1#9$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Allerdale",
        "text": "I'm going to tell Dad\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_663_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_655_1#1$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Allerdale",
        "text": "This is my home. Just like every Cumberland's done before me, I'll keep it, I'll protect it, until my life is over."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_663_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_655_1#9$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Allerdale",
        "text": "I swear."
    },
